 "caption_summary": "The five target-selection strategies on one external OCT example, not FairVision data: an annotation-free B-scan crop from Kulyabin et al., OCTDL, Fig. 1 (arXiv:2312.08255v3), adapted under CC BY 4.0 and downsampled to 256 by 256 pixels without contrast enhancement. (a) Placement guide A_s(x); MIRAGE was not trained on OCTDL. (b) One I-JEPA view: visible context C, target groups T_m (colour and number mark identity, not relevance), hidden non-targets (grey) and repeated indices (dots); the target rule follows Table tab:strategies. Exact indices from each trained sampler for this image (matched block sizes, fixed seed); a single illustrative replay, not a segmentation, training batch, evaluation sample or performance comparison. License: CC BY 4.0 URL.",
 "alt_text": "Ten panels in two rows over five columns (RANDOM, CENTROID, ENVELOPE, ANATOMY-V2, COVER) show the same external OCT crop. Top row: each strategy's placement guide in yellow (none for RANDOM). Bottom row: visible context as image, four target groups tinted orange, sky blue, green and purple with outlines and numbered badges 1 to 4, grey cells hidden but not predicted, white dots on repeated target indices.",
